### 1. Ambil semua data inventaris (GET)
GET http://localhost:8787/api/inventaris

### 2. Ambil detail satu barang (GET by ID)
GET http://localhost:8787/api/inventaris/2

### 3. Tambah barang baru (POST)
POST http://localhost:8787/api/inventaris
Content-Type: application/json

